(version 1)

# Home photoresist, two layer.
#
# Read out of the Eagle board, where this rule set was called
# "VaSe7u - Photo method". The constraints themselves live in the project
# file under Board Setup; they are repeated here so the ruleset is named
# and readable without opening KiCad.
#
#   minimum clearance      0.4572 mm  (18 mil)  mdWireWire, mdPadPad, mdViaVia
#   minimum track width    0.4064 mm  (16 mil)  msWidth
#   minimum hole to hole   0.3556 mm  (14 mil)  mdDrill
#   copper to board edge   0.4572 mm  (18 mil)  mdCopperDimension
#   minimum drill          0.8    mm            msDrill
#   SMD clearances         0.254  mm  (10 mil)  mdSmdPad, mdSmdVia, mdSmdSmd
